    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honey Glade \u2014 is your cozy mini apiary simulator, which will modestly settle at the bottom of the screen, accompanying you during work or study.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy simulator\ud83e\uddd8\u200d\u2640\ufe0f on your desktop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant unique flowers<strong>\ud83c\udf3c</strong> that attract cute bees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the hive<strong>\ud83c\udfe1</strong> and upgrade it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardworking bees\ud83d\udc1d, living their own lives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The charming neighbor \u2014 is a little rabbit<strong>\ud83d\udc07</strong> peacefully munching grass.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing gameplay with soothing melodies\ud83c\udfb6.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3bPlant bright flowers, from delicate daisies to exotic orchids that attract charming bees.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785780/extras/b9d1793bb9da7508fe73452a2577037e.poster.avif?t=1752173780\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785780/extras/b9d1793bb9da7508fe73452a2577037e.webm?t=1752173780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785780/extras/b9d1793bb9da7508fe73452a2577037e.mp4?t=1752173780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf6fCollect golden honey to improve the hive and unlock new types of flowers.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785780/extras/6b9c6e22ccaf0e885969529af0c39f9c.poster.avif?t=1752173780\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785780/extras/6b9c6e22ccaf0e885969529af0c39f9c.webm?t=1752173780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785780/extras/6b9c6e22ccaf0e885969529af0c39f9c.mp4?t=1752173780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc07</strong>Meet the cute fluffy rabbit that has settled in your meadow.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785780/extras/3d155cd1e2d235f80d2980e00f88f9aa.poster.avif?t=1752173780\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785780/extras/3d155cd1e2d235f80d2980e00f88f9aa.webm?t=1752173780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785780/extras/3d155cd1e2d235f80d2980e00f88f9aa.mp4?t=1752173780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd55Sometimes a rabbit gets scared of bees. Stroke him to give him courage.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785780/extras/f06364674ac090938647f5f905c1f9b3.poster.avif?t=1752173780\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785780/extras/f06364674ac090938647f5f905c1f9b3.webm?t=1752173780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785780/extras/f06364674ac090938647f5f905c1f9b3.mp4?t=1752173780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Collect moments of joy and even the most stressful day will become sweeter when your personal paradise blooms at the edge of the screen!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honey Glade \u2014 is your cozy mini apiary simulator, which will modestly settle at the bottom of the screen, accompanying you during work or study.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy simulator\ud83e\uddd8\u200d\u2640\ufe0f on your desktop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant unique flowers<strong>\ud83c\udf3c</strong> that attract cute bees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the hive<strong>\ud83c\udfe1</strong> and upgrade it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardworking bees\ud83d\udc1d, living their own lives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The charming neighbor \u2014 is a little rabbit<strong>\ud83d\udc07</strong> peacefully munching grass.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing gameplay with soothing melodies\ud83c\udfb6.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3bPlant bright flowers, from delicate daisies to exotic orchids that attract charming bees.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785780/extras/b9d1793bb9da7508fe73452a2577037e.poster.avif?t=1752173780\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785780/extras/b9d1793bb9da7508fe73452a2577037e.webm?t=1752173780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785780/extras/b9d1793bb9da7508fe73452a2577037e.mp4?t=1752173780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf6fCollect golden honey to improve the hive and unlock new types of flowers.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.